		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "8aa9b9a7-f2dd-40f9-95cb-503bff0ac607")
	)
	(text "with the LED off (above the 3.3V rail, held only by the module's ESD clamp),"
		(at 179.07 346.71 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "a0d87907-fc42-421b-b8c5-6e12c3f9cd27")
	)
	(text "and injecting ~7mA into an unpowered pad whenever this board is on and the sync"
		(at 179.07 351.79 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "b621c78d-073e-4aa3-ac61-2602621338c0")
	)
